tour feature-go-to-line
kind flow
author ai
group features/gui
note In the Source toolbar, type a line number in the 'line' field and press enter: the Source view selects that line and scrolls it into view, three lines from the top. The reader reaches for it to reach a known line number without scrolling for it. A number past either end is clamped to the file and the status bar says so; text that is not a number, or no open file, is reported in the status bar.

